      "type": "p",
      "content": "To manage consultant spending more effectively, a tiered vendor rating system (VRS) will be implemented. Consultants will be categorized as Strategic Partners (Tier 1), Preferred Suppliers (Tier 2), or Opportunistic (Tier 3). Allocation of budget spend will prioritize Tier 1 vendors who demonstrate measurable improvements in process efficacy and deep domain expertise in insurance risk modeling. Negotiations must emphasize outcome-based pricing (fixed deliverables) rather than time-and-materials (T&M)."
