      "type": "p",
      "content": "The increasing complexity of global climate risk mandates a rigorous review of supplier exposure. All high-value suppliers must submit evidence of their own adherence to robust disaster recovery planning (DRP) and cyber-resilience protocols. Failure to provide updated compliance documentation may result in mandatory reassessment or exclusion from the approved vendor list."
