      "title": "Streamlining Policy Compliance: An Overview of CCM Capabilities",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "content": "Welcome. The complexity of modern regulatory environments necessitates a centralized, adaptable platform for policy management. Our Content Management System (CCM) is designed to address the fragmentation inherent in traditional policy storage, ensuring consistency across all client touchpoints and internal operations. This presentation outlines how CCM modernizes the policy lifecycle from drafting to distribution."
